Important Updates
1. Planned Task – Clearer task details and progress tracking, making updates easy to follow;
2. Kazakh Language Support – Kazakh has been added as an interface language, enabling smooth thinking and borderless expression.
Improvements
1. Added a new topic shape – Card;
2. Floating topics now support freely adjusting the layer order;
3. Optimized some UI designs and text;
4. Optimized the display logic of Team on the Home;
5. Improved date selection logic in Planned Task;
6. Theme Editor now support selecting Grid structure;
7. Password visibility toggle is now supported in link sharing and file encryption;
8. Fixed collaboration issues caused by editing a planned task;
9. Fixed an issue where inserting Markers might cause the canvas to freeze;
10. Fixed an issue where the border opacity setting was not working in Grid structure;
11. Fixed an issue where clicking Relationship in the search panel did not trigger a jump;
12. Fixed an issue where inserting attachments larger than 20MB in topics might cause an error;
13. Fixed an issue where the app might crash after startup;
14. Fixed some other known issues.

Important Updates
One Team, Multiple Spaces - Create independent Spaces to keep work organized and permissions clear.
Improvements
1. Improved some UI designs and text;
2. Fixed an issue where the window flickered after selecting a color in Map Shot;
3. Fixed an issue where main topics in Grid structure couldn't switch structures;
4. Fixed an issue where Custom Color Themes lost previews;
5. Fixed some other known issues.

Important Updates
1. Smart Guideline – Easily align topics for a more efficient layout;
2. Map Search – Quickly find mind maps and easily find target content.
Improvements
1. Double-click to quickly edit cloud file names in the editor;
2. File paths in the editing page are clickable for quick navigation;
3. Optimized the PDF export effect;
4. Improved some UI designs and text;
5. Fixed an issue where Smart Guideline could not be enabled after enabling Flexible Floating Topic;
6. Fixed an issue where cloud files saved locally could not be edited after reloading.
7. Fixed an issue where the zoom level would automatically increase after switching the canvas;
8. Fixed an issue where specific font styles did not apply correctly;
9. Fixed an issue where user-defined default zoom ratio was not applied;
10. Fixed an issue where Boundary opacity did not automatically revert to the maximum value;
11. Fixed some other known issues.

Important Updates
1. Introduced a new text style — underline;
2. Enabled the import of iThoughts mind map files.
Improvements
1. Grid structure now supports modifying Cell alignment and fill color;
2. Grid structure now supports customizing border styles;
3. Enhanced the auto-naming logic for cloud files;
4. Enabled subscribed Team members to unlock paid features in local files;
5. Fixed an issue where subscribed Team members could not use paid templates;
